  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **This is My Father's World** (1 other source): Identified as a Methodist hymn, which suits the church venue [1]\n- **O Bless The Lord** (1 other source): Identified as a cover of a John Michaels song [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **This is My Father's World**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Surrounded**: rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n- **New Monster Avenue**: back after 91 archived shows (2738 days) [3]\n- **Genesis 30:3**: rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n- **Attention All Pickpockets**: rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n- **O Bless The Lord**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **Encore Break / Dungeoneering**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2015-09-12.radio.mp3.128** (recommended): source not stated; 21 songs; 75 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Alpha Rats nest, Animal Mask, Attention All Pickpockets, Baboon, Cubs in Five, Fall of the Star High School Running Back, Genesis 30:3, O Bless The Lord, Radio, Southwestern Territory, Steal Smoked Fish, Surrounded, There Will Be No Divorce, Werewolf Gimmick [1]\n- The show was solo, with John playing both guitar and piano [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2015-09-12.radio.mp3.128**: taped by u/AlwaysLupus [1]",
